WEBVTT

00:06:29.969 --> 00:06:34.557
and share those moves and that happiness
with those around you,

00:06:35.307 --> 00:06:37.351
because a world of more dance

00:06:37.351 --> 00:06:39.061
is a world of more joy.

00:06:39.103 --> 00:06:40.229
(Music)

00:06:41.105 --> 00:06:42.273
(Music stops)

00:06:42.648 --> 00:06:43.816
(Music)